    "diagnosis": "Proposed three-step model of tumorigenesis in ELP1-medulloblastoma syndrome",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Step&nbsp;1: germline variant results in monoallelic inactivation of <em>ELP1</em>. Step&nbsp;2: somatic deletion of chromosome&nbsp;9q results in biallelic inactivation of <em>ELP1</em> and concurrent monoallelic inactivation of <em>PTCH1</em>. Step&nbsp;3: somatic <em>PTCH1</em> mutation or focal deletion on 9q22.32 results in biallelic inactivation of <em>PTCH1</em>.",
